<div class="auth-card__icon">📜</div>
<h1>Find your link in the server logs</h1>
<p>
  This server can't send email yet, so the sign-in link for
  <strong><%= params[:email] %></strong> was written to its logs.
  It works once and expires in 15 minutes.
</p>
<p>
  <strong>Railway:</strong> open the service, then <em>Deploy Logs</em>, and search for <code>sign_in</code>.<br>
  <strong>Docker:</strong> run <code>docker logs ideafit</code>.
</p>
<p>
  To email links instead, set <code>SMTP_ADDRESS</code> and the other SMTP settings.
  Not running this server? Ask whoever does to set up email.
</p>
<div class="auth-footer">
  <%= link_to "Use a different email", new_user_session_path(return_to: params[:return_to]) %>
</div>
